# =============================================================================
# MiniAndroid .gitignore — S-SLIM consolidated edition (2026-11-23)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONE policy: the repository tracks SOURCE + CURATED EVIDENCE ONLY.
# Everything below is generated, fetched, run-produced, or local-only.
#
# Owner: release engineering (CONSTITUTION_V2 §172, docs/REPOSITORY_HYGIENE.md)
# Enforcement: tools/policy_validator.py (pre-commit hook + CI policy.yml)
#
# GIT FACT THIS FILE RELIES ON: .gitignore never untracks existing content.
# Tracked canonical evidence stays tracked regardless of these rules; NEW
# files under ignored trees need an explicit `git add -f` = deliberate,
# reviewable promotion (the frozen-evidence doctrine of docs/PATH_OWNERSHIP.json).
# Campaign names are deliberately NOT listed here: stable directory rules
# replace the historical per-session entries. History: docs/history/.
# =============================================================================

# --- build outputs (any naming convention, any depth) -----------------------
miniandroid/build*/
build*/
build-*/
/build_*/
/build-*/
*.o
*.d
*.obj
*.lib
*.a
*.ninja
*.ninja_deps
.ninja_log
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
compile_commands.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
core

# --- APK / DEX / dependency payloads — NEVER tracked (§20 zero-APK law) -----
*.apk
*.aab
*.dex
*.odex
*.aar
*.jar
*.so
*.dll
apk_cache/
miniandroid/download/
**/freetype-*/
**/harfbuzz-*/
**/fribidi-*/
**/zlib-*/
**/libpng-*/
**/jpeg-*/
**/libwebp-*/
**/rlottie-*/
**/hb.tgz
**/jpeg.zip

